  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n(√a + √b)/(√a - √b) = {(√a + √b) × (√a + √b)}/{(√a - √b) × (√a + √b)}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a - b)² = a² + b² - 2ab\n\na2 - b2 = (a + b) × (a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(√x - √y)/(√x + √y)\n\n⇒ {(√x - √y) × (√x - √y)}/{(√x + √y) × (√x - √y)}\n\n⇒ (√x - √y)²/}(√x)² - (√y)²\n\nNow, putting the value of x = 2 and y = 3\n\n⇒ (√2 - √3)2/}(√2)2 - (√3)2\n\n⇒ - {(√2)2 + (√3)2 - 2 × √2 × √3}\n\n⇒ - (2 + 3 - 2√6)\n\n⇒ 2√6 - 5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 2√6 - 5.**",
